    given-names: "Dwi"

abstract: >
  This dataset supports the study "Automated Cultural Content
  Classification in EFL Textbooks: An Imbalance-Aware ELECTRA
  Framework with LLM-Based Augmentation." The dataset contains
  2,195 text segments derived from eight English textbooks used
  under Indonesia's Merdeka Curriculum, covering Grades III, IV,
  V, VI, VII, VIII, IX, and XI. The text segments were annotated
  into four cultural categories: Non-Cultural (NC), Source Culture
  (SC), International Culture (IC), and Target Culture (TC).

keywords:
  - "EFL textbooks"
  - "cultural representation"
  - "natural language processing"
  - "ELECTRA"
  - "text classification"
  - "class imbalance"
  - "data augmentation"
  - "Merdeka Curriculum"

repository-code: "https://github.com/neni1705/Automated-Cultural-Content-Classification-in-EFL-Textbooks"
